{
  "slug": "seller",
  "title_en": "Understanding the Seller Yield Board: Best Theta \"Rent\" Opportunities",
  "excerpt_en": "Contracts with the highest daily time-decay yield relative to premium—attractive rent, but the building can collapse fast.",
  "body_en": "<!-- ===== OptionsAji 博客片段：卖方收益榜使用说明 ===== -->\n<style>\n  .aji-guide{--bg:#f5f2f0;--ink:#151617;--gold:#c9a227;--card:#fffdfb;--line:#e7e1d8;--muted:#6f6a63;--soft:#c9c2b6;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;line-height:1.75;font-size:16px;padding:4px}\n  .aji-guide h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2px}\n  .aji-guide h3{font-size:18px;margin:26px 0 8px;font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide p{margin:10px 0}.aji-guide .lead{font-size:17px}\n  .aji-guide .accent{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide .chart-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;margin:22px 0;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(21,22,23,.05)}\n  .aji-guide .chart-note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 14px}\n  .aji-guide canvas{max-width:100%}\n  .aji-guide .analogy{border-left:4px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(201,162,39,.07);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;margin:16px 0}\n  .aji-guide .formula{background:#151617;color:#f5f2f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;overflow-x:auto}\n  .aji-guide .formula b{color:var(--gold)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:14.5px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px}\n  .aji-guide .data-table th{background:var(--ink);color:#f5f2f0;text-align:left;padding:11px 14px;font-weight:600}\n  .aji-guide .data-table td{padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}\n  .aji-guide .data-table tr:nth-child(even) td{background:rgba(201,162,39,.035)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table .col{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}\n  .aji-guide .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px}\n  .aji-guide .tag-core{background:var(--gold);color:#fff}.aji-guide .tag-base{background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink)}\n  .aji-guide .calc{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:flex-end;margin:8px 0 4px}\n  .aji-guide .calc label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);gap:5px}\n  .aji-guide .calc input{width:150px;padding:9px 11px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}\n  .aji-guide .calc input:focus{outline:2px solid var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold)}\n  .aji-guide .verdict{margin-top:16px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;background:rgba(201,162,39,.12)}\n  .aji-guide .big-num{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:var(--gold);display:block;line-height:1.15}\n  .aji-guide .disclaimer{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:26px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n  .aji-guide .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(201,162,39,.3);transition:background .15s}\n  .aji-guide .cta:hover{background:#b8911f}\n  .aji-guide .cta-row{margin:16px 0 4px}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom{background:rgba(201,162,39,.08);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;margin:24px 0 8px;text-align:center}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom p{margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aji-guide\">\n  <h2>Understanding the Seller Yield Board: Best Theta \"Rent\" Opportunities</h2>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Option sellers are like <span class=\"accent\">landlords collecting rent</span>: sell premium, earn Theta daily. This board ranks <b>highest daily decay yield vs premium</b>—but high rent often means fragile structure.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-row\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/seller\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 Open live Seller Yield board →</a></div>\n  <h3>1. Theta: Daily Rent</h3>\n  <div class=\"analogy\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><b>Theta = how much option price decays per day.</b></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:4px 0\">Cost for buyers; income for sellers. We rank <span class=\"accent\">Theta relative to premium</span>, not absolute Theta alone.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"formula\">Daily decay yield = <b>Theta</b> / premium<br>Simple annualized ≈ daily yield × 365<br><b>Ex</b>: Theta $0.06, premium $1.50 → <b>4%/day</b> (read risk section first)</div>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">Time Value Decay: Faster Near Expiry (example)</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Non-linear—last 30 days accelerate. Rendered with Chart.js via jsDelivr CDN only.</p><canvas id=\"thDecay\" width=\"640\" height=\"300\" aria-label=\"Theta decay curve\"></canvas></div>\n  <h3>2. Calculator: Seller Daily Yield</h3>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">🧮 Seller Yield Calculator</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Theta vs premium is what matters. Local only.</p>\n  <div class=\"calc\"><label>Daily Theta ($/share)<input id=\"thTheta\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.06\" inputmode=\"decimal\"></label>\n  <label>Premium ($/share)<input id=\"thPrem\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1.50\" inputmode=\"decimal\"></label></div>\n  <div class=\"verdict\" id=\"thOut\"></div></div>\n  <h3>3. Column Guide</h3>\n  <table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Column</th><th>Meaning</th><th>How to use</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">#</td><td>Rank by daily decay yield.</td><td>Top = best rent efficiency.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Contract</td><td>Symbol, expiry, strike, side.</td><td>Sellers often pick OTM.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Theta <span class=\"tag tag-core\">Core</span></td><td>Daily time decay.</td><td>Seller income stream.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Daily Yield <span class=\"tag tag-core\">Core</span></td><td>Theta / premium—sort key.</td><td><span class=\"accent\">Relative return</span>.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">IV</td><td>Implied vol.</td><td>High IV → fat premium, fat risk.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">DTE</td><td>Days to expiry.</td><td>Shorter = faster decay, tighter risk.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Delta / Gamma <span class=\"tag tag-base\">Aux</span></td><td>Direction exposure &amp; change rate.</td><td>Rent behind the risk—always check.</td></tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n  <h3>4. Three Rules for Sellers</h3>\n  <p><b>1. High Theta ↔ high Gamma / IV.</b> Losses can dwarf premium. <b>Limited gain, large tail risk.</b><br><b>2. Prefer defined-risk spreads</b> over naked shorts.<br><b>3. Avoid earnings gaps</b>—one gap can erase months of rent.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-bottom\"><p>Ready to explore? See today's live data 👇</p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/seller\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 Open live Seller Yield board →</a></div><p class=\"disclaimer\">Data may be delayed ~15 minutes. For research only—not investment advice. Short options strategies can lose far more than premium collected. © OptionsAji</p>\n\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  if(typeof Chart==='undefined')return;\n  var GOLD='#c9a227',INK='#151617';\n  var dte=['60','50','40','30','20','15','10','7','5','3','1','0'];\n  var val=[2.00,1.82,1.60,1.35,1.05,0.86,0.63,0.48,0.36,0.22,0.09,0.00];\n  var c1=document.getElementById('thDecay');\n  if(c1){new Chart(c1,{type:'line',data:{labels:dte,datasets:[{label:'Time value (premium)',data:val,borderColor:GOLD,backgroundColor:'rgba(201,162,39,.14)',fill:true,tension:.35,pointRadius:0}]},\n    options:{responsive:true,plugins:{legend:{display:false},tooltip:{callbacks:{title:function(t){return 'DTE '+t[0].label+' days';},label:function(i){return 'Time value $'+i.parsed.y.toFixed(2);}}}},\n    scales:{x:{title:{display:true,text:'Days to expiry (DTE)',color:INK},ticks:{color:INK},grid:{display:false}},y:{ticks:{color:INK,callback:function(v){return '$'+v;}},grid:{color:'rgba(21,22,23,.06)'}}}}});}\n  var th=document.getElementById('thTheta'),pr=document.getElementById('thPrem'),out=document.getElementById('thOut');\n  function render(){\n    if(!out)return;\n    var t=parseFloat(th.value),p=parseFloat(pr.value);\n    if(!(t>=0)||!(p>0)){out.style.background='rgba(21,22,23,.05)';out.style.color='#6f6a63';out.innerHTML='Enter valid Theta and premium (premium &gt; 0).';return;}\n    var daily=t/p*100, annual=daily*365;\n    out.style.background='rgba(201,162,39,.12)';out.style.color='#151617';\n    out.innerHTML='卖方日衰减收益率 <span class=\"big-num\">'+daily.toFixed(2)+'% / day</span>Simple annualized ≈ '+annual.toFixed(0)+'%. ⚠️ Looks great in calm markets—adverse moves can lose far more than premium. Use spreads; avoid earnings.';\n  }\n  if(th&&pr){th.addEventListener('input',render);pr.addEventListener('input',render);render();}\n})();\n</script>\n<!-- ===== /片段结束 ===== -->"
}
